#: gitswitch/gui.py:522
msgid ""
"Paste a personal access token; the button next to the field opens the page "
"to create one. It needs the scopes read_user and write_repository, and api "
"for the GitLab tools of the MCP server. The token is kept in the system "
"keyring only."
